<section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl flex flex-col items-center text-center py-12">
  <div class="mb-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border bg-muted px-3 py-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground">
    <span class="size-1.5 rounded-full bg-primary"></span>
    Open source governance for AI coding agents
  </div>
  <h1 class="text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-6xl">
    Turn team knowledge into<br />
    <span class="text-primary">agent guardrails</span>
  </h1>
  <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg text-muted-foreground">
    Static docs don't enforce anything. ControlKeel turns your policies, review taste, and domain rules into live findings, proofs, approval gates, and budgets that work across every supported agent.
  </p>
  <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4">
    <a
      href={~p"/docs/getting-started"}
      class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-primary px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-primary-foreground shadow-lg shadow-primary/20 transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-primary/90"
    >
      <.icon name="hero-arrow-down-tray" class="size-4" /> Install ControlKeel
    </a>
    <a
      href="https://github.com/aryaminus/controlkeel"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener"
      class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border bg-muted px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold transition hover:border-primary/40 hover:bg-accent"
    >
      <.icon name="hero-star" class="size-4" /> Star on GitHub
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 py-12">
  <div class="rounded-xl border bg-card p-6">
    <div class="mb-3">
      <.icon name="hero-shield-check" class="size-8 text-primary" />
    </div>
    <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">Policy gates for agents</h3>
    <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
      Convert domain knowledge and review decisions into typed memory, policy checks, governed findings, and approval gates.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="rounded-xl border bg-card p-6">
    <div class="mb-3">
      <.icon name="hero-chart-bar-square" class="size-8 text-primary" />
    </div>
    <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">Evidence, not vibes</h3>
    <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
      Proof bundles, benchmark runs, and cost signals show whether agent workflows are getting safer and cheaper.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="rounded-xl border bg-card p-6">
    <div class="mb-3">
      <.icon name="hero-bolt-solid" class="size-8 text-primary" />
    </div>
    <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">Host-agnostic control</h3>
    <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
      Keep governance state outside the chat window so teams can move between supported agents without losing context.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl py-12">
  <h2 class="text-center text-3xl font-bold mb-4">How it works</h2>
  <p class="text-center text-sm text-muted-foreground mb-10">
    From intent to evidence in four steps
  </p>
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
    <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center">
      <div class="flex size-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary/10 text-primary mb-4">
        <.icon name="hero-document-text" class="size-5" />
      </div>
      <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold">Capture intent</h4>
      <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground mt-1.5">Set scope, policy, risk, and budget</p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center">
      <div class="flex size-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary/10 text-primary mb-4">
        <.icon name="hero-command-line" class="size-5" />
      </div>
      <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold">Agent works</h4>
      <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground mt-1.5">Use the host your team already likes</p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center">
      <div class="flex size-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary/10 text-primary mb-4">
        <.icon name="hero-shield-exclamation" class="size-5" />
      </div>
      <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold">CK validates</h4>
      <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground mt-1.5">
        Findings, proofs, and gates fire as needed
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center">
      <div class="flex size-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary/10 text-primary mb-4">
        <.icon name="hero-arrow-trending-up" class="size-5" />
      </div>
      <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold">Improve the loop</h4>
      <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground mt-1.5">Evals show what changed</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl py-12">
  <h2 class="text-center text-3xl font-bold mb-4">What it is not</h2>
  <p class="text-center text-sm text-muted-foreground mb-10">
    Clear scope, on purpose
  </p>
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
    <div class="rounded-xl border bg-card p-6 text-center">
      <div class="mb-3 flex justify-center">
        <.icon name="hero-code-bracket-square" class="size-8 text-primary" />
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold">Not another IDE or coding model</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-xl border bg-card p-6 text-center">
      <div class="mb-3 flex justify-center">
        <.icon name="hero-building-storefront" class="size-8 text-primary" />
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold">Not a prompt marketplace or generic memory API</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-xl border bg-card p-6 text-center">
      <div class="mb-3 flex justify-center">
        <.icon name="hero-eye-slash" class="size-8 text-primary" />
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold">Not passive monitoring or post-hoc review only</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl py-16 text-center">
  <div class="rounded-2xl border bg-muted p-10">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3">Ready to govern your agents?</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground mb-6">
      Install in under five minutes. No account required for local mode.
    </p>
    <a
      href={~p"/docs/getting-started"}
      class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-primary px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-primary-foreground transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-primary/90"
    >
      Get started <.icon name="hero-arrow-right" class="size-4" />
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
